{"id":"n73029-2-7","stage":5,"title":"인성 · 人性","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73029-2-7-1","ko":"김 교수, 이번에 교육 심리학 분야에서 새로운 프로젝트를 진행한다며?","zh":"金教授，听说这次您要在教育心理学领域开展一个新项目？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"교수,","meaning":"教授","explanation":"교수：教授","readings":[{"term":"교수","audio":"/audio/7d57c92d078bf33a0236.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31684","senseId":"2","lemma":"교수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교육","meaning":"教育，培训","explanation":"교육：教育，培训","readings":[{"term":"교육","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55289","senseId":"1","lemma":"교육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심리학","meaning":"心理学","explanation":"심리학：心理学","readings":[{"term":"심리학","audio":"/audio/d562a91b0baacd6e0ebf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66015","senseId":"1","lemma":"심리학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분야에서","meaning":"领域，方面","explanation":"분야：领域，方面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"분야","audio":"/audio/1f797b0c3d05100af080.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21113","senseId":"1","lemma":"분야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로운","meaning":"新","explanation":"새롭다：新；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"새롭다","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29029","senseId":"1","lemma":"새롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"프로젝트를","meaning":"项目，工程","explanation":"프로젝트：项目，工程；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"프로젝트","audio":"/audio/f05481bea1ddf15be9c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84499","senseId":"1","lemma":"프로젝트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진행한다며?","meaning":"进行，进展","explanation":"진행하다：进行，进展；ㄴ다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"진행하다","audio":"/audio/a3f14d01de54d8aa5658.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62339","senseId":"1","lemma":"진행하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7d57c92d078bf33a","term":"교수","zh":"教授","audio":"/audio/7d57c92d078bf33a0236.mp3","entryId":"31684","definition":"在大学里研究学问并讲授课程的人；或指其职位。","pronunciation":["교ː수"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"4da9a75910ede3ad","term":"교육","zh":"教育，培训","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3","entryId":"55289","definition":"为了培养个人能力，教授知识、教养和技术等。","pronunciation":["교ː육"]},{"id":"d562a91b0baacd6e","term":"심리학","zh":"心理学","audio":"/audio/d562a91b0baacd6e0ebf.mp3","entryId":"66015","definition":"研究人类或动物的意识和行动的学问。","pronunciation":["심니학"]},{"id":"1f797b0c3d05100a","term":"분야","zh":"领域，方面","audio":"/audio/1f797b0c3d05100af080.mp3","entryId":"21113","definition":"根据一定标准将社会活动划分而成的范围或部分之一。","pronunciation":["부냐"]},{"id":"0dd73a3ec7854899","term":"새롭다","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3","entryId":"29029","definition":"与至今为止的东西不同或不曾存在过。","pronunciation":["새롭따"]},{"id":"f05481bea1ddf15b","term":"프로젝트","zh":"项目，工程","audio":"/audio/f05481bea1ddf15be9c4.mp3","entryId":"84499","definition":"研究或事业；或指该计划。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a3f14d01de54d8aa","term":"진행하다","zh":"进行，进展","audio":"/audio/a3f14d01de54d8aa5658.mp3","entryId":"62339","definition":"将事情等继续做下去。","pronunciation":["진ː행하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f1a78c75fa139bc9bc61.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73029-2-7-2","ko":"네, 인성을 최대한 개발하고 발휘할 수 있는 프로그램을 만들어 볼 생각입니다.","zh":"是的，我打算设计一个能够最大限度地培养和发挥个人品格的课程。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인성을","meaning":"人性","explanation":"인성：人性；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인성","audio":"/audio/bf59c6bdae223c1465e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73029","senseId":"2","lemma":"인성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"최대한","meaning":"最大限度，尽量","explanation":"최대한：最大限度，尽量","readings":[{"term":"최대한","audio":"/audio/e07e06e8081eee807ffd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27773","senseId":"1","lemma":"최대한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개발하고","meaning":"开发，发掘","explanation":"개발하다：开发，发掘；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"개발하다","audio":"/audio/efdf0e73eeaac482e7e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62257","senseId":"2","lemma":"개발하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발휘할","meaning":"发挥，施展","explanation":"발휘하다：发挥，施展；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"발휘하다","audio":"/audio/f84df0049dc00c7b030b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15876","senseId":"1","lemma":"발휘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"프로그램을","meaning":"目录，计划，方案","explanation":"프로그램：目录，计划，方案；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"프로그램","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60621","senseId":"1","lemma":"프로그램","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들어","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각입니다.","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"bf59c6bdae223c14","term":"인성","zh":"人性","audio":"/audio/bf59c6bdae223c1465e5.mp3","entryId":"73029","definition":"每个人持有的想法、态度和行为特点。","pronunciation":["인성"]},{"id":"e07e06e8081eee80","term":"최대한","zh":"最大限度，尽量","audio":"/audio/e07e06e8081eee807ffd.mp3","entryId":"27773","definition":"在一定范围内最大的或最多的限度。","pronunciation":["최ː대한","췌ː대한"]},{"id":"efdf0e73eeaac482","term":"개발하다","zh":"开发，发掘","audio":"/audio/efdf0e73eeaac482e7e3.mp3","entryId":"62257","definition":"使能力或知识等变得更好。","pronunciation":["개발하다"]},{"id":"f84df0049dc00c7b","term":"발휘하다","zh":"发挥，施展","audio":"/audio/f84df0049dc00c7b030b.mp3","entryId":"15876","definition":"充分表现出才能或实力等。","pronunciation":["발휘하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f5044b9ba86548c9","term":"프로그램","zh":"目录，计划，方案","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3","entryId":"60621","definition":"写有某个活动的进行计划或顺序的目次；或指其详细的条目。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"在心里决意要做某事；或指想做某事的那种决心。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/767dad85e63bcc4de986.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.38,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73029","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":178,"sequenceScore":6.2067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，我打算设计一个能够最大限度地培养和发挥个人品格的课程。","金教授，听说这次您要在教育心理学领域开展一个新项目？","核能发电为什么有危险？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["金教授，听说这次您要在教育心理学领域开展一个新项目？","核能发电为什么有危险？","是的，我打算设计一个能够最大限度地培养和发挥个人品格的课程。"],"answer":2}]}
